Subject: [PATCH 01/15] Count market statistics data points toward market_data
 completeness

refresh_catalog_completeness only recognised vwap among the market
statistics published as data points, so previous_close, returns and the
other market_prices-domain fields stayed missing even when current.
Count every catalogued market_prices field that has a current data point.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CfTpoii6QDStyTPdotmEdY
---
